# Episodes from Liberty City from a fresh profile (no episode save): the episode picker,
# then a day and a night-rain drive inside the episode's opening mission. The action bench's
# teleports fail the opening mission (the episode's flow restarts it at once, even after
# TERMINATE_ALL_SCRIPTS_WITH_THIS_NAME), so this stays where the mission allows. The picker needs a
# held button (400 ms): the default 150 ms press is missed while it loads.
# Run: tools/perf/route_bench.sh pad career-street tools/perf/pads/eflc-tbogt-bench.pad <label> --gta4_edition=eflc
awaitframe
# The Rockstar logo runs ~15 s after the first frame; the picker is up well before 30 s.
wait 30s
hold right 400ms
wait 2s
hold a 400ms
wait 8s
# Again in case the first was early; the new-game loading screen ignores it.
hold a 400ms
await 6m
wait 10s
# Skip the opening cutscene (A); harmless once it is over.
hold a 400ms
wait 4s
hold a 400ms
wait 4s
hold a 400ms
wait 4s
hold a 400ms
wait 4s
hold a 400ms
wait 4s
hold a 400ms
wait 4s
# I Luv L.C.: Luis gets into Tony's car (Y) and the game's AI drives it around Algonquin with Tony
# aboard (leaving Tony fails the mission; driving anywhere does not).
nowanted
invincible
clock 13 0
weather 1
hold y 600ms
wait 7s
where
drive 15
mark all
mark drive
wait 35s
mark drive_end
shot {out}/shots/1-drive.png 0.5
clock 21 30
weather 4
mark night
wait 30s
mark night_end
shot {out}/shots/2-night.png 0.5
mark all_end
where
wait 1s
quit
